","v":"일반야영장(15면)","items":["일반야영장(15면)"]},{"k":"기타 부대시설","v":"화봉커피 카페 / B 개러지 / 24마켓 / 샤워장 / 개수대 / 화장실","items":["화봉커피 카페 / B 개러지 / 24마켓 / 샤워장 / 개수대 / 화장실"]},{"k":"바닥형태 (단위:면)","v":"테크 (4) · 자갈 (11)","items":["테크 (4)","자갈 (11)"]},{"k":"사이트 크기","v":"7 X 7 : 11개 · 6 X 5 : 4개"},{"k":"캠핑장비대여","v":"캠핑장 문의","items":["캠핑장 문의"]},{"k":"반려동물 출입","v":"소형견만 가능"},{"k":"화로대","v":"개별"}],"photos":["https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101446/5278cssPXvjKeLsEFPQ4Tf04.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101446/3571mN0GbipepeIibMTPyHgB.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101446/2775ZmhINWMhNPe5tjD4aJxg.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101446/5136ywzDP3nPsc7t2g8MW6Ph.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101446/8536p3eXnMr23jgGH2zYKBtq.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101446/6547HYTo1WWwtGLoGns1bxnb.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101446/1720TJsDI4WCLyG7NI01FvPi.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101446/7731izjJYMXAfd3m20m0ZLSK.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101446/8019F6DfLC7qXWLVa192BsOp.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/101446/8060fYQ3pQvCgk0rrP0y8Uav.jpg"],"guide":[{"title":"일반캠핑","table":{"cols":["평상시 주중","평상시 주말","성수기 주중","성수기 주말"],"rows":[{"label":"일반","values":["50,000 ~100,000","50,000 ~100,000","50,000 ~100,000","50,000 ~100,000"]}]}}],"checked_at":"2026-10-20T03:38:07.212Z"}}